Column name: no_cars Type: NUMBER Description: Car-free households. The number of households without passenger cars, vans, and pickup or panel trucks of one-ton capacity or less kept at home and available for the use of household members. Vehicles rented or leased for one month or more, company vehicles, and police and government vehicles are included if kept at home and used for non-business purposes. Dismantled or immobile vehicles ware excluded. Vehicles kept at home but used only for business purposes also are excluded.
