Column name: in_grades_1_to_4 Type: FLOAT Description: Students Enrolled in Grades 1 to 4. The total number of people in each geography currently enrolled in grades 1 through 4 inclusive.  This corresponds roughly to elementary school.
Column name: housing_built_2005_or_later Type: FLOAT Description: Housing units built in 2005 or later. A house, an apartment, a mobile home or trailer, a group of rooms, or a single room occupied as separate living quarters, or if vacant, intended for occupancy as separate living quarters built in 2005 or later.
