Column name: white_including_hispanic Type: FLOAT Description: White including Hispanic
Column name: employed_transportation_warehousing_utilities Type: FLOAT Description: Workers employed in firms in transportation, warehousing, and utilities. The Transportation and Warehousing sector includes industries providing transportation of passengers and cargo, warehousing and storage for goods, scenic and sightseeing transportation, and support activities related to modes of transportation. The modes of transportation are air, rail, water, road, and pipeline.
Column name: male_45_64_graduate_degree Type: FLOAT Description: Men age 45 to 64 who obtained a graduate or professional degree
Column name: income_less_10000 Type: FLOAT Description: Households with income less than $10,000. The number of households in a geographic area whose annual income was less than $10,000.
Column name: pop_16_over Type: FLOAT Description: Population age 16 and over. The number of people in each geography who are age 16 or over.
Column name: commute_25_29_mins Type: FLOAT Description: Number of workers with a commute between 25 and 29 minutes. The number of workers in a geographic area over the age of 16 who do not work from home and commute in between 25 and 29 minutes. 
Column name: pop_5_years_over Type: FLOAT Description: Population 5 Years and Over. The number of people in a geographic area who are over the age of 5.  This is primarily used as a denominator of measures of language spoken at home.
Column name: pop_determined_poverty_status Type: FLOAT Description: Population for Whom Poverty Status Determined. The number of people in each geography who could be identified as either living in poverty or not.  This should be used as the denominator when calculating poverty rates, as it excludes people for whom it was not possible to determine poverty.
Column name: dwellings_1_units_detached Type: FLOAT Description: Single-family (one unit) detached dwellings. This is a 1-unit structure detached from any other house, that is, with open space on all four sides. Such structures are considered detached even if they have an adjoining shed or garage. A one-family house that contains a business is considered detached as long as the building has open space on all four sides. Mobile homes to which one or more permanent rooms have been added or built also are included.
Column name: commute_35_39_mins Type: FLOAT Description: Number of workers with a commute between 35 and 39 minutes. The number of workers in a geographic area over the age of 16 who do not work from home and commute in between 35 and 39 minutes. 
Column name: employed_arts_entertainment_recreation_accommodation_food Type: FLOAT Description: Workers employed in firms in arts, entertainment, recreation, accommodation and food services. The Arts, Entertainment, and Recreation sector includes a wide range of establishments that operate facilities or provide services to meet varied cultural, entertainment, and recreational interests of their patrons. This sector comprises (1) establishments that are involved in producing, promoting, or participating in live performances, events, or exhibits intended for public viewing; (2) establishments that preserve and exhibit objects and sites of historical, cultural, or educational interest; and (3) establishments that operate facilities or provide services that enable patrons to participate in recreational activities or pursue amusement, hobby, and leisure-time interests.
Column name: female_65_to_66 Type: FLOAT Description: Female age 65 to 66. The female population between the age of sixty-five years to sixty-six years within the specified area.
